.Dd March 12, 2026
.Dt DEVFS_NAMING 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm devfs_naming
.Nd persistent devfs aliases for device-model nodes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In vfs/vfs.h
.Ft int
.Fn devfs_register_alias "const char *path" "const char *target"
.Ft void
.Fn devfs_unregister_alias "const char *path"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Substrate devfs supports framework-managed symlink aliases under
.Pa /dev/by-id
for devices that expose stable identity through a serial string or GUID.
These aliases point at the published primary device node path.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr devfs_hotplug 9 ,
.Xr device 9
